  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "Children are mapped as 'celebrating the weekend like'",
  "description": "The text 'celebrating the weekend like' is juxtaposed with the visual of two Black children joyfully playing in water. The mapping implies that the children’s spontaneous, uninhibited celebration (as expressed through their joyful poses and play) is being equated with how one might celebrate the weekend — specifically, in a manner that is perceived as primitive, unrefined, or culturally exotic. This mapping is central to the meme’s intent and relies on the visual material to instantiate the textual claim.",
